{"what_happened": "On 2026-10-26 at 12:51:50, U0367, a CARD nurse scheduled 08:00-17:00 that day, read P01928's record for 28s (A0335) from D0093, a CARD workstation (L1; G1; G2; G10; G18).",
 "purpose_evidence": [
