 "rationale": "G4 shows a 'proximity' connection between U0192 and P02841 and G3 shows no encounter, so the facts show a personal connection with no job-related purpose — the escalate case. Access was brief read/query only (L1-L3, G10) with no copy action, so medium rather than high priority."
