{"what_happened": "During a scheduled MED1 evening shift (G1;G2), nurse U0036 opened VIP patient P02410's record three times, all reads (A0335, A0381, A0278 per G10), on shared workstation D0076 between 19:16 and 19:19 on 2026-10-14 (L1;L2;L3;G4;G6).",
 "purpose_evidence": [
   {"claim": "The access fell within U0036's scheduled 15:00-23:00 shift in MED1 and used a MED1 workstation, so the user was on duty at a unit device", "sources": ["G1","G2","G6","L1"]},
   {"claim": "No job-related purpose is shown: P02410 has no encounter in the period, and the only recorded U0036-P02410 connection is a personal 'organization co-worker' tie, not a care or task link", "sources": ["G3","G5"]}
 ],
 "risk_indicators": [
   {"claim": "P02410 carries the VIP flag, a heightened-sensitivity marker", "sources": ["G4"]},
   {"claim": "U0036's only tie to P02410 is an 'organization co-worker' connection through department ORTH, while U0036 works in MED1 - a personal connection with no job-related purpose shown", "sources": ["G5","G1","G3"]}
 ],
 "missing_information": [
   "Whether U0036's supervisor can document any work reason for accessing P02410 (none appears in the facts, G3)",
   "The nature of the 'organization co-worker' connection (G5) - whether it reflects a personal relationship beyond co-employment",
   "Whether policy requires a documented reason for VIP-record access and whether U0036 recorded one",
   "Whether the same-shift accesses to other patients (L4-L33) were routine duties, confirming P02410 as the outlier"
 ],
 "disposition": "escalate",
 "priority": "high",
 "rationale": "VIP patient (G4) with no encounter (G3) was read three times by a nurse whose only link is an 'organization co-worker' connection (G5) - a personal connection with no shown job purpose, meeting the escalate bar. VIP status raises priority (G4). Access was on-shift, read-only, and brief (G2;G10;L1-L3), so no alteration concern."
}

