 "rationale": "Shift-timed, unit-device access within a broad multi-patient workflow looks routine (G1, G2, G21, L6-L35), but no fact shows why a MED2 nurse opened a patient with no MED2 encounter (G3-G5), and the session began with a delete (L1; G22). No personal tie exists (G8). Ask the supervisor to confirm assignment and the delete's target."
